        {
          "id": "1782992034116",
          "code": "PROCESS_LEDGER_METADATA",
          "type": "CODE",
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Process Ledger Metadata",
            "sourceCode": "let response = $context.$nodes.FETCH_METADATA_INFORMATION.$output;\nlet avMetadata = {};\nconst parseAVMetadata = ( avRes) => {\n  let avMetadataArr = Array.isArray( avRes) ? avRes : avRes?.items || [];\n  let hierarchyMetaData = {};\n  let bossAv = {};\n  let module = {};\n  avMetadataArr.forEach(( hierObj) => {\n    if( hierObj.UIFLAG === \"Y\") {\n      let hierMDObj = {};\n      hierMDObj.columnOrder = hierObj.DIMENSIONSEQUENCENUMBER;\n      hierMDObj.label = hierObj.DIMENSIONDISPLAYNAME;\n      hierMDObj.dimensionAttributeName = hierObj.DIMENSIONATTRIBUTENAME;\n      hierMDObj.hierarchyDisplayName = hierObj.HIERARCHYDISPLAYNAME;\n      hierMDObj.segmentTypeCode = hierObj.SEGMENTTYPECODE;\n      hierarchyMetaData[ hierObj.HIERARCHYNAME] = hierMDObj;\n    }\n    if( hierObj.SEGMENTTYPECODE === \"MD\") {\n      let dimensionAttr = hierObj.DIMENSIONATTRIBUTES;\n      if( typeof dimensionAttr == 'string') {\n        dimensionAttr = JSON.parse( dimensionAttr);\n      } bossAv = {\n        bossAvName: dimensionAttr?.avMetadata?.bossAvName\n      };\n      module = {\n        avModuleName: dimensionAttr.avMetadata.avModuleName\n      };\n    }\n  });\n  return {\n    hierarchyMetaData,\n    ...bossAv,\n    ...module\n  };\n};\nreturn parseAVMetadata( response);",
            "returnType": "object"
          },
          "diagram": {
            "x": 5413.75,
            "y": 8812
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1777372299859"
          },
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"required\": [\n    \"result\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Build Application Context",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "let currentLedger = $context.$nodes.PROCESS_DEFAULT_LEDGER.$output.result;\nlet periodName = $context.$nodes.PROCESS_SELECTED_PERIOD_NAME.$output.result;\n\nlet validatedLedgerandPeriods = Array.isArray($context.$nodes.FETCH_PERIOD_END_DATE.$output) ? $context.$nodes.FETCH_PERIOD_END_DATE.$output : [];\nlet endDateforPeriod = validatedLedgerandPeriods[0]?.ENDDATE || $context.$nodes.FETCH_ACCOUNTING_PERIODS_DATA.$output.items[0].endDate ||\"-1\";\n\nif(endDateforPeriod === \"-1\") {\n\n}\n\nlet ORA_GL_RULE_CATEGORY = $context.$nodes.PROCESS_RULE_CATEGORY_RESPONSE.$output.result;\n\nlet ORA_FUN_RULE_PRIORITY = $context.$nodes.PROCESS_RULE_PRIORITY_RESPONSE.$output.result;\n\nlet ORA_FUN_RULE_FREQUENCY = $context.$nodes.PROCESS_RULE_FREQUENCY_RESPONSE.$output.result;\n\nlet metadata = $context.$nodes.PROCESS_LEDGER_METADATA.$output.result;\n\nconst context = {\n  ...currentLedger,\n  ...metadata,\n  periodName: periodName,\n  endDate : endDateforPeriod,\n  ORA_GL_RULE_CATEGORY : ORA_GL_RULE_CATEGORY,\n  ORA_FUN_RULE_PRIORITY : ORA_FUN_RULE_PRIORITY,\n  ORA_FUN_RULE_FREQUENCY : ORA_FUN_RULE_FREQUENCY,\n  hasMany: false,\n  appContextUpdated: false,\n  refreshApp: false\n};\n\nreturn context;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "BUILD_APPLICATION_CONTEXT",
          "id": "1777372299859",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"required\": [\n    \"result\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE",
          "diagram": {
            "x": 5413.75,
            "y": 9034
          }
        },
        {
          "aiAppOutputSpecification": {
            "dataDisplay": {
              "customNotes": ""
            }
          },
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Extract Ledger Information",
            "answerInUserLanguage": true
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1781171897110"
          },
          "code": "EXTRACT_LEDGER_INFORMATION",
          "id": "1778591642425",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1778591642425_systemPrompt",
              "name": "systemPrompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": ""
            },
            {
              "id": "1778591642425_prompt",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "**Inputs**\n\nDefaultLedgerName = {{$context.$nodes.PROCESS_DEFAULT_LEDGER.$output.result.ledgerName}}\nDefaultPeriodName = {{$context.$nodes.FETCH_ACCOUNTING_PERIODS_DATA.$output.items[0].periodName}}\nInput_Message = {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}} or {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.inputMessage}}\nAction_Payload = {{$context.$nodes.PROCESS_ACTION_CODE.$output.result}}\n\nResolve `ledgerName` and `periodName` from `Input_Message` or `Action_Payload`.\n\n**Defaults:**\n- Default ledgerName: $DefaultLedgerName\n- Default periodName: $DefaultPeriodName\n- Use a default only when the user did not ask to change that field.\n\n**Ledger resolution:**\n1. If the user asks to set, change, use, or switch ledger, extract the ledger name.\n2. Extract ledger names with or without quotes.\n   - `Set ledger to Vision.` means ledgerName is `Vision`.\n   - `Set ledger to \"Vision\".` means ledgerName is `Vision`.\n   - `Set ledger` means ledgerName is ``.\n3. For unquoted ledger names, take the text after words like `ledger to`, `ledger`, or `for ledger`.\n4. Stop ledger extraction before another field such as `period`.\n5. Remove wrapping quotes and trailing punctuation.\n6. If the user did not ask to change ledger, return default ledgerName.\n\n**Period resolution:**\n1. If the user asks to set, change, use, or switch period, extract the period name.\n2. Extract period names with or without quotes.\n3. For unquoted period names, take the text after words like `period to`, `period`, or `for period`.\n4. Stop period extraction before another field such as `ledger`.\n5. Remove wrapping quotes and trailing punctuation.\n6. If the user did not ask to change period, return default periodName.\n\n**Combined rules:**\n- If only ledger is requested, resolve ledger and use default periodName.\n- If only period is requested, use default ledgerName and resolve periodName.\n- If both ledger and period are requested, resolve both.\n- Do not use defaults for a field the user explicitly requested.\n- Never include ledgerId.\n- Never mention that a returned value is empty.\n\n**Message:**\n- Write one short user-facing sentence describing the action.\n- Use ledger name and periodName when helpful.\n\nReturn only valid JSON in this exact shape:\n{\n  \"ledgerName\": \"\",\n  \"periodName\": \"\",\n  \"message\": \"\"\n}\n\nPopulate values with the resolved results.\nDo not include markdown, commentary, or explanation."
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"ledgerName\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"periodName\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"message\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"ledgerName\",\n    \"periodName\",\n    \"message\"\n  ],\n  \"additionalProperties\": false\n}",
          "type": "LLM",
          "diagram": {
            "x": 6264.25,
            "y": 7924
          }
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Prepare Payload Query For Ledger Selection",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "let partialLedgerName = $context.$nodes.EXTRACT_LEDGER_INFORMATION.$output.ledgerName || \"\";\n\nlet payload = {\n    \"viewQueries\": {\n        \"glDataAccessSetLedgers\": {\n            \"module\": \"oraErpCoreGeneralLedgerSetup\",\n            \"businessObject\": \"DataAccessSetLedger\",\n            \"view\": \"dataAccessSetLedgerList\",\n            \"fieldAliases\": {\n                \"accessSetId\": \"accessSetId\",\n                \"ledger.ledgerId\": \"ledgerId\",\n                \"ledger.name\": \"ledgerName\"\n            }\n        },\n        \"glAccessSets\": {\n            \"module\": \"oraErpCoreGeneralLedgerSetup\",\n            \"businessObject\": \"DataAccessSet\",\n            \"view\": \"dataAccessSetList\",\n            \"fieldAliases\": {\n                \"accessSetId\": \"accessSetId\",\n                \"name\": \"accessSetName\",\n                \"defaultLedger.ledgerId\": \"defaultLedgerId\",\n                \"chartOfAccount.structureInstanceNumber\": \"chartOfAccountsId\"\n            }\n        },\n        \"ledger\": {\n            \"module\": \"oraErpCoreStructure\",\n            \"businessObject\": \"Ledger\",\n            \"view\": \"ledgerList\",\n            \"fieldAliases\": {\n                \"calendar.periodSetName\": \"periodSetName\",\n                \"calendar.calendarId\": \"calendarId\",\n                \"currency.currencyCode\": \"currencyCode\",\n                \"ledgerId\": \"ledgerId\",\n                \"ledgerCategory.meaning\": \"ledgerCategory\",\n                \"name\": \"ledgerName\",\n                \"chartOfAccount.structureInstanceNumber\": \"chartOfAccountsId\"\n            }\n        }\n    },\n    \"select\": `SELECT DISTINCT ledger.ledgerId, ledger.ledgerCategory, ledger.chartOfAccountsId, ledger.ledgerName, ledger.periodSetName, ledger.calendarId, ledger.currencyCode, 'Y' as suspenseAllowedFlag FROM  ledger, glDataAccessSetLedgers WHERE ledger.ledgerId = glDataAccessSetLedgers.ledgerId and glDataAccessSetLedgers.accessSetId IN (select glAccessSets.accessSetId from glAccessSets) and glDataAccessSetLedgers.accessSetId IN (select glAccessSets.accessSetId from glAccessSets) AND UPPER(ledger.ledgerName) LIKE UPPER('%${partialLedgerName}%') order by ledger.ledgerName asc FETCH FIRST 10 ROWS ONLY`,\n    \"return\": [\n        {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"name\": \"ledgerId\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"name\": \"ledgerCategory\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"name\": \"chartOfAccountsId\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"name\": \"ledgerName\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"name\": \"periodSetName\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"name\": \"calendarId\"\n        },\n         {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"name\": \"currencyCode\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"name\": \"suspenseAllowedFlag\"\n        }\n    ]\n}\n\nreturn payload;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1779095940484"
          },
          "code": "PREPARE_PAYLOAD_QUERY_FOR_LEDGER_SELECTION",
